    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

Check Statuses after NR RAT Reset and Wait for OnAir
    [Arguments]    ${bts_type}

    ${rat_reset_timeout}                                    Get Timeout Rat Reset
    ...                                                     rat=nr

    Robot Log Operation                                     Waiting for modules startup after NR RAT reset...

    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer                 ${rat_reset_timeout}
    ...                                                     5sec
    ...                                                     Check all BBMODs RMODs and cells states for all RATs
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Verifying BTS OnAir state...
    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer                 5min
    ...                                                     10s
    ...                                                     Verify BTS states
    ...                                                     status=OnAir
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Alarms.Disallow X2 Link Alarms

    Robot Log Result                                        NR RAT reset procedure has finished succesfully. BTS is fully operational.

